WEBVTT

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:17.601
Excuse me.

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:21.021
You're Sorawo Kamikoshi, right?

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.695
Oh, a blue color contact.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:32.366
It <i>is </i>you, Sorawo, that sophomore
from the liberal arts department.

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:34.326
That's right, but...

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:35.994
Mind if I join you?

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:37.579
Huh? Oh, sure.

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:39.790
Thank you.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.125
Sorry to ambush you like this.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.962
I'm Akari Seto. I'm in my first year here.

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:48.298
I wanted to ask you for some advice.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.467
Advice? Why me?

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.219
I heard about you.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:54.388
You're an expert in this kind of thing.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:56.390
Um, what kind of thing?

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:00.269
You know, scary stuff like the supernatural.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:03.397
You have the sixth sense, don't you?

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:09.027
Huh?!

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.071
Oh, no, there must be some mistake.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.657
I don't have the sixth sense
or anything like that.

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:15.200
I'm under attack.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.535
Huh?

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:18.829
Please don't laugh, but...

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:21.331
I'm under attack by...

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:23.041
...ninja cats.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.334
What?

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:43.437
<i>School never taught me what friends are</i>

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:48.817
<i>People are such difficult creatures</i>

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:53.238
<i>This world where you never</i>
<i>know what's said behind your back</i>

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:58.785
<i>Looks a little ugly to me</i>

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:03.665
<i>Compassion and ego sway on the scales</i>

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:08.212
<i>They've swayed ever since I met you</i>

00:02:08.212 --> 00:02:11.131
<i>Your trespassing did a number on me</i>

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:15.427
<i>It's not like anyone would do</i>

00:02:15.427 --> 00:02:15.511
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:15.511 --> 00:02:16.678
"Kisaragi"
"Katasu - Yami"
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:20.933
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:25.270
<i>Like a fish out of water</i>

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.564
<i>Delicacy and literacy</i>

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:30.150
<i>Might not be necessary</i>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.362
<i>I just want to be wanted</i>

00:02:33.362 --> 00:02:35.739
<i>Selfish little me</i>

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:39.910
<i>The scales have tipped</i>

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.162
<i>As friends</i>

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:48.168
<i>Let's meet in a secret place</i>

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:58.011
Attacked by ninja cats?

00:03:00.764 --> 00:03:02.099
Ninja cats!

00:03:02.099 --> 00:03:03.517
Is it that funny?

00:03:03.517 --> 00:03:05.185
Yeah! And super cute!

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:08.689
Ninja cats, huh?

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:11.567
She must be high.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:14.778
Don't take whatever drugs she offers.

00:03:14.778 --> 00:03:16.738
You're already weird enough.

00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:19.950
I don't do drugs! And I'm not weird!

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:23.203
Besides, there's a pretty famous
urban legend on the net

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:27.249
about being attacked by ninja cats.

00:03:27.249 --> 00:03:31.253
"Please listen to this strange
tale that began a week ago.

00:03:31.253 --> 00:03:35.299
First of all, I want everyone to
know I'm not delusional or mentally ill.

00:03:35.299 --> 00:03:37.426
Please don't laugh. This is true.

00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:40.888
Ninja cats have been attacking me lately."

00:03:40.888 --> 00:03:43.765
That's just like me.

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:47.811
Or you just copied it off the internet.

00:03:47.811 --> 00:03:52.149
I don't know where you heard that
I have the sixth sense, but I don't.

00:03:52.149 --> 00:03:54.234
And if you're trying to pull a prank--

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:55.360
I knew it!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.614
You <i>are </i>an expert, aren't you!

00:03:58.614 --> 00:03:59.907
No, I told you--

00:03:59.907 --> 00:04:01.700
Here's my number.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:06.955
Going to the shrine didn't help.
You're my only hope now.

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:10.876
Call me anytime. My fate is in your hands!

00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:18.509
What's she expect me to do?

00:04:29.394 --> 00:04:31.522
What the heck?

00:04:31.522 --> 00:04:35.150
That sounds like an episode from the Otherside.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.986
Ninja cats?

00:04:37.986 --> 00:04:41.198
You're kidding, right?
I mean, it's not even scary.

00:04:41.198 --> 00:04:43.742
Otherside encounters are more...

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.037
...mysterious...

00:04:50.707 --> 00:04:52.292
...creepy...

00:04:53.877 --> 00:04:55.254
...and terrifying.

00:04:55.254 --> 00:05:00.175
Yeah, but different people
fear different things.

00:05:00.175 --> 00:05:02.135
You may be able to handle it, Sorawo,

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:07.224
but her fear of ninja cats
might reach a traumatic level.

00:05:07.224 --> 00:05:09.768
What's that?

00:05:09.768 --> 00:05:10.811
A tanuki.

00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:12.396
A tanuki?

00:05:12.396 --> 00:05:17.484
You heard what happened when
you went off to the Otherside alone.

00:05:17.484 --> 00:05:19.027
Yeah, but...

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:23.448
I got mixed up in that crazy mess,
and a bunch of weirdos came here.

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:27.619
They looked like ordinary old ladies, but...

00:05:28.871 --> 00:05:33.542
Anyway, this protects me
because they were really tanuki.

00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:36.336
As long as I believe that, it's not as scary.

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:43.510
In short, you're controlling your fear
of the unknown by putting a name to it.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.137
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:45.137 --> 00:05:49.057
Unlike you guys, I've got
a really low tolerance for fear.

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:50.809
Yeah, but...

00:05:50.809 --> 00:05:51.810
Huh?

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.645
That's not a tanuki.

00:05:53.645 --> 00:05:54.313
--What?

00:05:54.313 --> 00:05:55.731
--That's a raccoon.
--What?

00:05:55.731 --> 00:05:57.941
You can tell by the striped tail.

00:05:59.776 --> 00:06:05.616
Raccoons dig through garbage cans.
Doesn't that make them vermin?

00:06:05.616 --> 00:06:07.951
Shut up! This is a tanuki!

00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:11.121
I don't care what anyone says! It's a tanuki!

00:06:12.664 --> 00:06:18.629
S-Sorawo, don't tell me you invited
something else weird over here?

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:20.464
--Sorawo.

00:06:20.464 --> 00:06:21.256
--Yeah.
--Sorawo.

00:06:21.256 --> 00:06:21.673
--Yeah.
--Don't act like this is business as usual!

00:06:21.673 --> 00:06:24.676
--Don't act like this is business as usual!

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:29.014
What are you two trying to do to my home?

00:06:32.184 --> 00:06:35.312
Miss Kozakura? There's a delivery for you.

00:06:37.731 --> 00:06:40.776
I need your signature if you don't mind.

00:06:40.776 --> 00:06:43.946
You don't need to worry about him... probably.

00:06:43.946 --> 00:06:49.743
Thanks. Could I please have
your signature right here?

00:06:49.743 --> 00:06:54.706
It's pretty big.
Where would you like me to put it?

00:06:54.706 --> 00:06:59.545
Huh? Tobacco Farming Vehicle AP-1?

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.847
Well?

00:07:09.847 --> 00:07:11.056
Oh, um...

00:07:11.056 --> 00:07:13.392
Come to think of it, we...

00:07:13.392 --> 00:07:16.770
Check this out, Sorawo. Isn't it super cute?

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.730
Hey, you're right. Should we buy it?

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:22.401
We'd like one of these. Please deliver it to...

00:07:22.401 --> 00:07:24.778
It was love at first sight.

00:07:24.778 --> 00:07:28.115
We thought it might help us
get around on the Otherside.

00:07:28.115 --> 00:07:31.743
You've got some nerve!
This is <i>my </i>house, not yours!

00:07:31.743 --> 00:07:36.123
Leave me out of this from now on!

00:07:37.958 --> 00:07:39.459
She really chewed us out.

00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:43.255
We'll have to figure out how
to get the AP-1 to the Otherside.

00:07:43.255 --> 00:07:45.799
But I'm drawing a blank.

00:07:45.799 --> 00:07:47.885
Look, a cat.

00:07:47.885 --> 00:07:52.431
I was thinking about that story.
Maybe we should help her.

00:07:52.431 --> 00:07:53.724
Yeah.

00:07:53.724 --> 00:07:56.768
What was her name again? Akari?

00:07:56.768 --> 00:08:01.023
She's being terrorized by ninja cats, right?

00:08:01.023 --> 00:08:04.943
It didn't seem like she was all that scared.

00:08:04.943 --> 00:08:08.280
But it didn't seem like she was lying, either.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.950
Then let's give her a call and hear her out.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.828
Yeah, but...

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:18.165
Sorawo, what's wrong? You're acting kinda weird.

00:08:18.165 --> 00:08:20.375
I'm not acting weird.

00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:24.922
Yes, you are. You may hesitate at first,
but you always end up helping.

00:08:24.922 --> 00:08:28.258
Why don't you want to this time?

00:08:30.135 --> 00:08:34.056
It's just, cats are so darn cute.

00:08:34.056 --> 00:08:38.852
I like them, so I don't wanna get
involved in some scary cat-adventure.

00:08:38.852 --> 00:08:42.105
I don't wanna end up hating them.

00:08:43.941 --> 00:08:47.152
Okay. But if this involves the Otherside,

00:08:47.152 --> 00:08:50.531
they aren't actually cats,
even if they look like them.

00:08:50.531 --> 00:08:52.699
It's like the old ladies at Kozakura's house.

00:08:52.699 --> 00:08:54.201
That's my point.

00:08:54.201 --> 00:08:54.826
--Hm?

00:08:54.826 --> 00:08:55.452
--I'd have to shoot them.
--Hm?

00:08:55.452 --> 00:08:57.287
--I'd have to shoot them.

00:08:57.287 --> 00:09:00.958
Got it. You don't have to do any shooting.

00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:02.751
If things go south, I'll--

00:09:02.751 --> 00:09:04.461
You could shoot them?

00:09:04.461 --> 00:09:06.755
You don't think cats are cute?

00:09:06.755 --> 00:09:10.509
They're cute, but animals are
more formidable than humans.

00:09:10.509 --> 00:09:12.553
We can't let our guard down.

00:09:12.553 --> 00:09:15.264
Yeah, but...

00:09:15.264 --> 00:09:17.057
Get a grip, Sorawo.

00:09:17.057 --> 00:09:21.728
These aren't ordinary cats.
They're monsters from the Otherside.

00:09:23.146 --> 00:09:26.483
And that means one thing.
We do what we always do.

00:09:26.483 --> 00:09:30.404
We find the ninja cats,
expose their true form with your right eye,

00:09:30.404 --> 00:09:33.073
and eliminate them.

00:09:33.073 --> 00:09:36.159
Besides, I have a feeling...

00:09:40.539 --> 00:09:43.458
...we're already mixed up in this.

00:09:52.259 --> 00:09:53.802
Ah, Sorawo!

00:09:53.802 --> 00:09:55.220
Hi.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.681
Thanks for calling.

00:09:57.681 --> 00:10:00.100
I look forward to working with you!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.560
Yeah, okay.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.605
Oh, and someone else will be joining us today.

00:10:04.605 --> 00:10:06.190
Oh, who?

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:10.402
Toriko... Toriko Nishina.

00:10:10.402 --> 00:10:13.322
Is she another expert just like you?

00:10:13.322 --> 00:10:15.657
Like I said, I'm not...

00:10:15.657 --> 00:10:17.326
So she's just a friend?

00:10:17.326 --> 00:10:18.702
A friend?

00:10:18.702 --> 00:10:23.165
Yeah, I guess you could say that, but...

00:10:23.165 --> 00:10:25.000
What do you mean?

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.504
Well, she is, but she isn't.

00:10:28.504 --> 00:10:32.132
Toriko is, um, how can I put it?

00:10:32.132 --> 00:10:34.259
Hi! I'm her partner in crime.

00:10:34.259 --> 00:10:35.135
Huh?

00:10:35.135 --> 00:10:37.387
Oh, I'm not?

00:10:40.557 --> 00:10:43.894
You know how cats sometimes
gather in big groups?

00:10:43.894 --> 00:10:46.897
Well, about a month ago,

00:10:46.897 --> 00:10:52.110
I came across one of their
gatherings in my neighborhood.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:55.030
Late one night, I suddenly
felt like some ice cream.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.074
On the way back from the store...

00:10:57.074 --> 00:11:01.245
We found the sign.

00:11:01.245 --> 00:11:03.997
It's almost here.

00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:08.377
Take it back. Take it back. Take it back.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.438
That's when it started.

00:11:34.486 --> 00:11:36.071
What do you think?

00:11:36.071 --> 00:11:37.406
This goes on every night?

00:11:37.406 --> 00:11:41.660
Yeah. But if I put up with it
for a while, they'll quiet down.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.037
Is this one with the yellow eyes a ninja cat?

00:11:44.037 --> 00:11:45.247
Probably.

00:11:45.247 --> 00:11:47.291
I didn't get a good look,

00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:50.419
but I think it's the same one
that follows me during the day.

00:11:50.419 --> 00:11:53.005
What? They follow you in the daytime, too?

00:11:53.005 --> 00:11:57.759
Yeah, and not only that.
They also attack me with weapons.

00:11:59.428 --> 00:12:04.308
That's why I came to you for advice.
I'm under attack by ninja cats.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:10.814
Oh, um, you haven't taken
a video of a daytime attack?

00:12:10.814 --> 00:12:16.069
I tried a few times,
but I never was able to take a good one.

00:12:17.571 --> 00:12:20.282
I can't tell from this.

00:12:20.282 --> 00:12:25.913
What exactly do these ninja
cats you've seen look like?

00:12:25.913 --> 00:12:28.207
I hope they're not very cute.

00:12:28.207 --> 00:12:30.834
Let me think...

00:12:30.834 --> 00:12:34.254
Oh, just like that.

00:12:42.638 --> 00:12:43.597
Ninja...

00:12:43.597 --> 00:12:45.599
...cats!

00:12:57.819 --> 00:12:59.404
This is...

00:12:59.404 --> 00:13:01.156
...the Space-Time Man's world.

00:13:01.156 --> 00:13:02.658
Huh? What the heck's that?

00:13:02.658 --> 00:13:07.663
It's the region between the Otherside
and our world. I've been there before.

00:13:07.663 --> 00:13:10.082
Look out. They're coming!

00:13:20.425 --> 00:13:22.302
Are you all right?

00:13:22.302 --> 00:13:24.137
Umm, yeah?

00:13:24.137 --> 00:13:26.098
That was amazing.

00:13:26.098 --> 00:13:30.227
Yeah, well, I know a little karate.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:34.147
Let's get out of here!

00:13:35.315 --> 00:13:35.482
"Access restricted to cats only."

00:13:35.482 --> 00:13:37.693
"Access restricted to cats only."
What the--? That notice wasn't here before.

00:13:37.693 --> 00:13:39.278
What the--? That notice wasn't here before.

00:13:39.278 --> 00:13:40.654
Who cares?!

00:13:40.654 --> 00:13:42.573
Here they come!

00:13:47.995 --> 00:13:51.123
They're relentless. They really are ninja.

00:13:51.123 --> 00:13:53.250
It's been like this all month?

00:13:53.250 --> 00:14:00.716
Yeah. At first, they just followed me,
but it got much worse over the past week.

00:14:06.972 --> 00:14:10.475
This is bad. We gotta get out of here!

00:14:17.524 --> 00:14:19.860
Don't stop short like that!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.116
A cat... town?

00:14:26.116 --> 00:14:29.161
I don't know, but...

00:14:29.161 --> 00:14:31.455
We can't go back now.

00:14:34.249 --> 00:14:38.629
I'm surprised you've survived
so long against an enemy like that.

00:14:38.629 --> 00:14:41.757
Yeah! I chalk it up to my karate, I guess.

00:14:41.757 --> 00:14:43.800
I doubt it's your karate.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:49.932
Unless we find somewhere to make a stand,
we won't be able to fight back.

00:14:49.932 --> 00:14:52.267
We gotta fight cats, huh?

00:14:52.267 --> 00:14:54.561
You're still going on about that?

00:14:54.561 --> 00:14:57.773
Any way you slice it, these cats are <i>not </i>cute!

00:15:00.484 --> 00:15:02.778
Sorawo, I'm gonna use this.

00:15:02.778 --> 00:15:04.738
N-No way!

00:15:04.738 --> 00:15:08.992
It's too late now. She'll just have
to become our partner in crime.

00:15:08.992 --> 00:15:11.828
Don't say that!

00:15:11.828 --> 00:15:17.084
She can't be our partner in crime.
Don't ever say that again.

00:15:17.084 --> 00:15:17.334
--Sorawo--

00:15:17.334 --> 00:15:18.877
--She can be... a victim.
--Sorawo--

00:15:18.877 --> 00:15:20.838
--She can be... a victim.

00:15:22.506 --> 00:15:24.132
Got it.

00:15:24.132 --> 00:15:28.595
Akari, this may be a bit shocking,
so apologies in advance.

00:15:28.595 --> 00:15:32.933
Sorry, but if you tell anyone
about this, you'll regret it.

00:15:32.933 --> 00:15:34.434
Oh, okay...

00:15:34.434 --> 00:15:36.061
Can you see them?

00:15:36.061 --> 00:15:38.272
Looking now...

00:15:38.272 --> 00:15:42.192
Please don't look like cats.
Please don't look like cats.

00:15:43.777 --> 00:15:46.321
They look like cats.

00:15:46.321 --> 00:15:50.117
No change at all. They really
are cats. I don't wanna shoot.

00:15:50.117 --> 00:15:53.370
Get a grip! They're coming to kill us!

00:16:00.335 --> 00:16:02.129
That was close!

00:16:09.553 --> 00:16:10.888
Sorawo!

00:16:23.525 --> 00:16:26.153
Stand back!

00:16:43.795 --> 00:16:45.631
It's no use. They're...

00:16:45.631 --> 00:16:50.135
I don't get it. None of
my kicks or punches work.

00:16:50.135 --> 00:16:54.806
I'm close enough, but it doesn't
feel like I've landed a single blow.

00:16:54.806 --> 00:16:58.101
They're just like the Space-Time Man.

00:16:58.101 --> 00:17:03.357
We can see them, but they have no
physical body. How are we gonna...?

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:04.775
Sorawo. You okay?

00:17:04.775 --> 00:17:07.819
Y-Yeah, but...

00:17:07.819 --> 00:17:12.241
Umm... what do you suppose they're doing?

00:17:12.241 --> 00:17:14.034
How should I know?

00:17:14.034 --> 00:17:16.495
What's in your purse?

00:17:16.495 --> 00:17:19.373
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:17:19.373 --> 00:17:21.375
Any raw fish?

00:17:21.375 --> 00:17:22.709
Of course not.

00:17:22.709 --> 00:17:23.669
Catnip?

00:17:23.669 --> 00:17:25.087
Why would I?

00:17:25.087 --> 00:17:27.548
Then do you have any idea
why they'd be attacking you?

00:17:27.548 --> 00:17:29.466
Did you ever abuse a cat?

00:17:29.466 --> 00:17:30.717
No, never!

00:17:30.717 --> 00:17:32.010
Ah!

00:17:35.681 --> 00:17:37.432
What is it, Sorawo?

00:17:37.432 --> 00:17:41.144
I found what they're looking for.

00:17:43.522 --> 00:17:45.566
That must be the "sign."

00:17:45.566 --> 00:17:47.609
You are so mean!

00:17:50.028 --> 00:17:55.742
Why would you say that, Sorawo?

00:17:57.411 --> 00:17:58.912
Toriko, your left hand!

00:17:58.912 --> 00:17:59.371
--Huh?

00:17:59.371 --> 00:18:00.122
--Take off your glove quick!
--Huh?

00:18:00.122 --> 00:18:01.373
--Take off your glove quick!

00:18:01.373 --> 00:18:07.880
I would never ever, ever, ever
hurt or do anything mean to a cat.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.714
Akari?

00:18:08.714 --> 00:18:11.175
It's probably because
I looked at her with my right eye.

00:18:11.175 --> 00:18:13.427
Come on, Toriko, quick!

00:18:15.596 --> 00:18:17.264
What're you doing?

00:18:17.264 --> 00:18:20.100
Something's inside her. Try to find it.

00:18:23.437 --> 00:18:25.063
There's something hard in there!

00:18:25.063 --> 00:18:25.898
Pull it out!

00:18:25.898 --> 00:18:28.358
R-Roger!

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.249
That was mean.

00:18:44.249 --> 00:18:46.835
Why'd you punch me in the stomach?

00:18:48.921 --> 00:18:50.964
Never mind that.

00:18:50.964 --> 00:18:52.966
Any idea what this is?

00:18:52.966 --> 00:18:54.676
Oh, that?

00:18:54.676 --> 00:18:57.721
It's my good luck charm! Someone gave it to me.

00:18:57.721 --> 00:19:02.142
But I suddenly lost it one day.
Where'd you find it?

00:19:04.603 --> 00:19:06.438
Look out!

00:19:06.438 --> 00:19:07.189
--Sorawo!

00:19:07.189 --> 00:19:08.524
--Right.
--Sorawo!

00:19:16.782 --> 00:19:19.535
Get rid of it, quick!

00:19:19.535 --> 00:19:20.369
I will!

00:19:20.369 --> 00:19:21.995
What are you waiting for?

00:19:21.995 --> 00:19:25.832
I wonder if we could've sold this to Kozakura.

00:19:45.143 --> 00:19:48.313
I guess that's a wrap... I hope.

00:19:48.313 --> 00:19:50.274
They won't come back, will they?

00:19:50.274 --> 00:19:55.863
Probably not. But now we have
to figure out how to get out of here.

00:20:06.665 --> 00:20:09.960
What's... going on?

00:20:22.764 --> 00:20:25.017
Sorawo.

00:20:25.017 --> 00:20:26.852
Sorawo.

00:20:26.852 --> 00:20:28.604
Sorawo!

00:20:29.771 --> 00:20:32.024
We're back.

00:20:34.735 --> 00:20:39.114
Sorawo, Toriko! Thank you so very much!

00:20:39.114 --> 00:20:43.785
That was amazing! Are you always
doing dangerous stuff like that?

00:20:43.785 --> 00:20:47.581
Um, Akari? Remember,
mum's the word about you know what.

00:20:47.581 --> 00:20:48.832
My lips are sealed.

00:20:48.832 --> 00:20:52.961
I'm really sorry about your good luck charm.

00:20:52.961 --> 00:20:55.005
Don't worry. It's fine.

00:20:55.005 --> 00:20:58.509
After all, that's why I was being attacked.

00:20:58.509 --> 00:21:01.053
You mentioned someone gave it to you.

00:21:01.053 --> 00:21:03.472
Do you remember who?

00:21:03.472 --> 00:21:06.934
A tutor who used to teach me at home last year.

00:21:06.934 --> 00:21:09.144
It's for good luck in entrance exams.

00:21:09.144 --> 00:21:13.440
I treasured it, but one day, it just vanished.

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:17.319
Who was your tutor?
Do you know how to get in touch?

00:21:17.319 --> 00:21:22.908
Actually, I suddenly lost
touch about six months ago.

00:21:22.908 --> 00:21:25.494
Her name was Miss Uruma.

00:21:41.802 --> 00:21:44.221
Satsuki Uruma?

00:21:44.221 --> 00:21:47.099
Yeah. Do you know her?

00:21:51.395 --> 00:21:53.897
Satsuki...

00:21:53.897 --> 00:21:56.066
...Uruma.

00:21:58.068 --> 00:22:02.030
"Attack of the Ninja Cats"

00:22:11.623 --> 00:22:15.878
<i>My hair was tossed by the cold wind</i>

00:22:15.878 --> 00:22:20.007
<i>Did you notice me shut the window?</i>

00:22:20.007 --> 00:22:24.303
<i>I lose my nerve when we get so close</i>

00:22:24.303 --> 00:22:28.182
<i>I don't need something that won't last</i>

00:22:28.182 --> 00:22:30.309
<i>Flashbacks hurt</i>

00:22:30.309 --> 00:22:31.935
<i>Ever-lingering shadows</i>

00:22:31.935 --> 00:22:36.106
<i>I know I'm too bound by the past, aren't I?</i>

00:22:36.106 --> 00:22:38.525
<i>Hey, this feeling we felt</i>

00:22:38.525 --> 00:22:44.114
<i>There's no doubt about it,</i>
<i>it's got to be special</i>

00:22:44.114 --> 00:22:47.951
<i>You and me, crisscrossing emotions</i>

00:22:47.951 --> 00:22:52.164
<i>I don't want to look back with regret</i>

00:22:52.164 --> 00:22:57.002
<i>I tell myself to believe</i>

00:22:57.002 --> 00:23:00.964
<i>And I tell my heart,</i>
<i>trust me, trust me, so sparkly</i>

00:23:00.964 --> 00:23:04.760
<i>It's the rhythm of a racing pulse</i>

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:08.972
<i>As I gazed at your outstretched hand</i>

00:23:08.972 --> 00:23:15.103
<i>I decided I'd put my trust in you</i>

00:23:15.103 --> 00:23:23.529
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>

00:23:23.529 --> 00:23:30.911
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will</i>

00:23:32.496 --> 00:23:34.748
Cats are so cute. I just adore them.

00:23:34.748 --> 00:23:35.582
Sorawo?

00:23:35.582 --> 00:23:36.458
Meow!

00:23:36.458 --> 00:23:38.126
Yikes! What's up with that?

00:23:38.126 --> 00:23:39.628
I-meow Sora-meow!

00:23:39.628 --> 00:23:40.462
Another beer?

00:23:40.462 --> 00:23:41.755
Marr-meow me-meow!

00:23:41.755 --> 00:23:42.589
Grilled beef?

00:23:42.589 --> 00:23:43.966
Why don't you understand?!

00:23:43.966 --> 00:23:47.803
Huh? Wait, why are you turning red?
